                        "sense_id": "945900e6-da30-30ad-be20-d404ce1e158b",
                        "entry_id": "6d2a6edf-463e-3cc1-a03c-959466b6f759",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A trident, seen as a religious symbol of Hinduism and Buddhism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Hinduism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0e9eaf5-fc4b-4422-9943-da6236a5794a",
                                "sense_id": "945900e6-da30-30ad-be20-d404ce1e158b",
                                "text": "It may be wondered, at first sight, that the innumerable texts left by Buddhism give us no positive information with regard to the meaning and origin of the trisula."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "777af14e-6236-4deb-9bf1-16933656fa39",
                                "sense_id": "945900e6-da30-30ad-be20-d404ce1e158b",
                                "text": "The trisula placed upon a pillar surmounted by flames is the monogram of Buddha."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c5f1a12-fe51-4f04-87e7-09e64029e707",
                                "sense_id": "945900e6-da30-30ad-be20-d404ce1e158b",
                                "text": "She had a trishul in one hand. Her long raven-black hair was left loose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4be93734-74d3-44ab-89c4-d03bd84f0c76",
                                "sense_id": "945900e6-da30-30ad-be20-d404ce1e158b",
                                "text": "The trishula is most commonly associated with the god Shiva, one of the most prominent Hindu deities and the primary god in the sect of Hinduism known as \"Shaivism.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
